WEBVTT

00:06:01.163 --> 00:06:03.038
I bought the little I could.

00:06:04.038 --> 00:06:05.288
But ...

00:06:05.954 --> 00:06:12.871
That priceless, intact,
one-of-a-kind collection,

00:06:12.913 --> 00:06:15.329
from that day forth,

00:06:15.329 --> 00:06:17.621
of rich Black history,

00:06:17.621 --> 00:06:20.704
100 years of rich Black history,

00:06:20.704 --> 00:06:23.204
was henceforward scattered to the wind.

00:06:23.579 --> 00:06:30.579
The same thing happened
at the estate sale of poet Maya Angelou.